    <string name="setup_title">THIS APP NEEDS SHIZUKU — NO ROOT NEEDED</string>
    <string name="setup_body">1) Enable Developer options: Settings → About phone → tap Build number 7×.\n2) In Developer options turn ON Wireless debugging (keep phone on Wi-Fi).\n3) Install Shizuku from Play Store, open it, tap Pairing → Start via Wireless debugging, enter the pairing code, then tap Start.\n4) Back here, tap the UPLINK button and Allow Shizuku access.\n5) When LINK shows ONLINE, IGNITE works. No Shizuku = buttons stay locked.</string>
